{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Different.</b> From the root of שנוי, and it is a descriptive noun, like the pattern of פעול; likewise ועם שונים." "<b>According to the hand of the king.</b> Like ככח, for strength is seen in the hand."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The lemma שונים appears to be drawn from the verse's meaning; I translate it literally without resolving which specific form in the verse he addresses."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:38.075764941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}